  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2025000,
      "startingMessageId": [
        202500000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "202500000": {
          "id": 202500000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "地址：庇尔波因特星际和平公司战略投资部，真珠个人工作室•3F。",
          "next": [
            202500001
          ]
        },
        "202500001": {
          "id": 202500001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}，往后星穹列车如有打算弃置的损物、废物，可以寄给我，我会回收。",
          "next": [
            202500002,
            202500005
          ]
        },
        "202500002": {
          "id": 202500002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "这是你的副业吗？",
          "next": [
            202500003
          ]
        },
        "202500003": {
          "id": 202500003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "副业的定义是：在主职之外，利用业余时间从事的、有经济收入的第二职业。",
          "next": [
            202500004
          ]
        },
        "202500004": {
          "id": 202500004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "但严格来说，「废物回收计划」是由我付费给你们。",
          "next": [
            202500009
          ]
        },
        "202500005": {
          "id": 202500005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "废物？哪里有废物？人可以回收吗？",
          "next": [
            202500006
          ]
        },
        "202500006": {
          "id": 202500006,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "next": [
            202500007
          ]
        },
        "202500007": {
          "id": 202500007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "严格来说，有机生命也可以「废物再造」。只是回收报价，不在我预算之内。",
          "next": [
            202500008
          ]
        },
        "202500008": {
          "id": 202500008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "但其余物品，我的回收预算充足。",
          "next": [
            202500009
          ]
        },
        "202500009": {
          "id": 202500009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "回收废物，然后收藏吗？",
          "next": [
            202500010
          ]
        },
        "202500010": {
          "id": 202500010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "是收藏前的步骤。对我来说，修复过去的物件，更像一场「说修就修的颅内旅行」。",
          "next": [
            202500011
          ]
        },
        "202500011": {
          "id": 202500011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "在「诸世界重建计划」的工作过程中，我修复过许多无主的遗产。",
          "next": [
            202500012
          ]
        },
        "202500012": {
          "id": 202500012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "当我一点点拼合它们的纹理，一颗陌生星球的信息，就会涌入我的脑海——风铃、浅滩、冰川，和更多难以言表的文明与风景。",
          "next": [
            202500013
          ]
        },
        "202500013": {
          "id": 202500013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "通常在那之后，我会沉浸式工作很久。",
          "next": [
            202500014,
            202500016,
            202500019
          ]
        },
        "202500014": {
          "id": 202500014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "真羡慕你的爱好……",
          "next": [
            202500015
          ]
        },
        "202500015": {
          "id": 202500015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "居然就是工作",
          "next": [
            202500020
          ]
        },
        "202500016": {
          "id": 202500016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "和你们工作狂拼了",
          "next": [
            202500017
          ]
        },
        "202500017": {
          "id": 202500017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "「拼」豆吗？",
          "next": [
            202500018
          ]
        },
        "202500018": {
          "id": 202500018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "开个玩笑。",
          "next": [
            202500020
          ]
        },
        "202500019": {
          "id": 202500019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "修复万物不如行万里路，暂停工作！去旅行！",
          "next": [
            202500020
          ]
        },
        "202500020": {
          "id": 202500020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "这让我想起，曾经媒体问我的一个问题：您如何平衡工作与生活？",
          "next": [
            202500021
          ]
        },
        "202500021": {
          "id": 202500021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "首先，我建议他：问问路易斯•弗莱明。其次，我回答他：你如何平衡呼吸和活着？他没有再追问。",
          "next": [
            202500022
          ]
        },
        "202500022": {
          "id": 202500022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "再则：修复星穹列车废置的、或沿途拾取的损物，也是一种感受「开拓」的艺术之旅。",
          "next": [
            202500023
          ]
        },
        "202500023": {
          "id": 202500023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "对了，一个热知识：大海里的珍珠，也是一种「废物再造」。",
          "next": [
            202500024
          ]
        },
        "202500024": {
          "id": 202500024,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "next": [
            202500025
          ]
        },
        "202500025": {
          "id": 202500025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "这笔私人交易长期有效，期待星穹列车寄来的「旅行好物」。",
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        1503,
        8001
      ]
    }
  ]
}